# moonlight-qt posture patch series. Applied in order with `git am --3way`
# (see tools/apply-series.sh). A line starting with `# group: NAME` starts a
# group; every patch below it belongs to that group until the next marker.
# Groups can be switched off with `apply-series.sh --skip-group NAME`.
# Order matters: the touch-menu group builds on files the posture-core group
# creates (streamingpreferences, SettingsView.qml, session.*, app.pro), so it
# must stay after it; posture-core applies and builds without touch-menu.

